memo cannot be displayed until the <abb>FD</abb> 1 is engaged.</para></note></comment></action><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008919.0006001.021" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008919.0006001.037" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If <if-installed>ADS-B</if-installed> or <if-installed>EHS</if-installed>is required for the intended flight:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008919.0006001.038"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008919.0006001.039" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008919.0006001.022"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">ATC</tech-label></challenge><response>1</response></cr-action></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>